## can_construct_building

* Supported Scopes: STATE
* Supported Targets: none

```
Checks if the country (as ROOT) and state in scope can build a building in the state.
ex:
GER = {
	65 = {
		can_construct_building = land_facility
	}
}
```

### Example <a id="Example"></a>

```text
my_state_targeted_decision = {
    state_target = yes
    target_root_trigger = {
        has_completed_focus = my_focus
    }
    target_array = GER.core_states
    target_trigger = {
        FROM = {
            is_owned_by = ROOT
        }
    }
    on_map_mode = map_and_decisions_view
    icon = my_icon
    cost = 20
    complete_effect = {
        FROM = {
            remove_core_of = GER
        }
    }
}
```

1. ↑ `CAMERA_MIN_HEIGHT = 50.0` in [Defines](<Defines - Hearts of Iron 4 Wiki.md>)
2. ↑ `CAMERA_MAX_HEIGHT = 3000.0` in [Defines](<Defines - Hearts of Iron 4 Wiki.md>)

